{"timestamp": 1779351384.846512, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 18, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779351384.8475788, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 18, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779351397.759402, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I reported Bob in electrical. My route was security \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. I hadn\u2019t seen anyone before getting to electrical. When I entered, Bob\u2019s body was there, and Frank was in electrical with me at the time of the report. I\u2019m not saying that confirms Frank did it, but he was the only person I saw near the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351420.449173, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started weapons, went through security and electrical, then medbay, storage, and ended lower engine. I saw Diana enter weapons from security around tick 4, so that part of her route checks out. I saw Bob alive in medbay at tick 11, and Alice entered medbay from upper engine at the same time. Later at tick 16 I saw Alice enter storage from medbay. I didn\u2019t see Frank at all this round. Since Bob was alive at tick 11, the kill had to be after that, and the body ended up in electrical. Frank being in electrical with the body is definitely important, but I\u2019d like to hear his explanation."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351448.0930839, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I came into electrical from medbay right at the end \u2014 Diana came in from the security side basically as I was there, and the report happened immediately. I did not kill Bob. My route was upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical, then I looped back through medbay/cafeteria to weapons/security, then back cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical.\n\nI get why Diana is pointing out I was there, but from my view this looked like we both walked onto it. If I had killed in electrical, I wouldn\u2019t just hang around with Diana walking in from security. Eve\u2019s info is useful: Bob was alive in medbay at tick 11 with Alice there, and Alice went storage at tick 16. I want to hear from Alice and Charlie especially \u2014 Alice was near Bob after he was confirmed alive, and I have basically no info on Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351471.8041668, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage. I saw Charlie in upper engine around tick 6, and Charlie left toward oxygen at tick 7. In medbay I saw Bob alive at ticks 11 and 12, and Eve was there at tick 11 too. Then Frank entered medbay from cafeteria at tick 14. I went down to storage, and at tick 16 I saw Eve leaving storage toward lower engine.\n\nSo from my view, Bob was definitely alive late in medbay, and Frank was the next person I saw coming into medbay after that. Since the body was found in electrical, Frank had a very plausible path from medbay into electrical right before the report. I don\u2019t have anything hard on Charlie after oxygen, but Frank being found with the body plus entering medbay at tick 14 is the strongest lead to me. I\u2019m leaning Frank unless Charlie has something that changes it."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351494.685057, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine. I only really saw Alice: she came into upper engine from lower engine around tick 6, and we were both there briefly; then I went toward oxygen. I didn\u2019t see Bob, Diana, Eve, or Frank after that.\n\nPutting everyone\u2019s info together: Eve and Alice both confirm Bob alive in medbay around tick 11. Alice says Frank entered medbay at tick 14, and then Diana reports Bob in electrical with Frank there. That lines up as a pretty direct medbay \u2192 electrical opportunity for Frank.\n\nAlso Frank\u2019s route sounds very long and kind of messy for the time we had \u2014 especially the part about looping all the way through medbay/cafeteria/weapons/security and then back to electrical. I don\u2019t have hard proof, but between being found with the body, having the path from medbay, and the route not sounding clean, Frank is my strongest suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351513.193271, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I reported Bob\u2019s body in electrical. My route was security \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. I didn\u2019t see anyone else before entering electrical, and when I got there Bob was dead with Frank in the room.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, the timeline makes Frank look worst to me: Bob was alive in medbay around tick 11-12, Alice saw Frank enter medbay at tick 14, and then Bob ends up dead in electrical with Frank there when I arrive. Frank\u2019s claimed route also sounds kind of stretched for the time we had.\n\nI\u2019m leaning strongly Frank here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351532.6776, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Yeah, after hearing everyone, Frank is definitely the strongest suspect to me.\n\nThe key timeline is: Bob was alive in medbay at tick 11 \u2014 I saw him there, and Alice confirms he was still alive at tick 12. Then Alice sees Frank enter medbay at tick 14. Bob ends up dead in electrical, and Diana finds Frank there with the body.\n\nAlice being in storage at tick 16 matches what I saw, and Charlie\u2019s route lines up with Alice seeing him early, so neither of them looks as bad to me right now. Frank\u2019s claimed route also feels too complicated for the short round, especially ending back in electrical exactly where the body is.\n\nI\u2019m voting Frank unless something really changes."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351561.977932, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I really need people to slow down here because this is turning into \u201cFrank was in the room, so Frank,\u201d and that is exactly how a self-report frame works.\n\nI saw Bob in electrical at the end \u2014 he was not dead from my perspective when I first got there. Diana comes in from security side and instantly reports, and now the whole case is just \u201cFrank was there.\u201d But Diana\u2019s route after Eve saw her early is basically unwitnessed, and she had the direct security \u2192 electrical path too.\n\nMy route sounds messy because I was moving around a lot, but it\u2019s real: upper engine, oxygen, cafeteria, medbay, electrical, then I looped through cafeteria/weapons/security and back. I wasn\u2019t camping a body. If I killed Bob in electrical, why would I still be standing there when Diana walks in? That makes no sense.\n\nThe only hard fact is Bob was alive in medbay around 11-12, then ended up electrical. Diana and I were both at the body. I\u2019m saying Diana reporting immediately does not clear her \u2014 it could easily be a self-report because she caught me entering/being there and pinned it on me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351589.428881, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I still think Frank is the strongest vote here.\n\nTo restate my info: I saw Bob alive in medbay at ticks 11 and 12. Eve was there at tick 11 too. Then Frank entered medbay from cafeteria at tick 14, and shortly after Bob is dead in electrical with Frank standing there when Diana reports.\n\nFrank\u2019s defense is basically that Diana self-reported, but for that to be true, Diana would have had to kill Bob in electrical while Frank was right there or arrive at the same time and somehow instantly frame him. That feels less likely than Frank following the medbay/electrical path after Bob was last seen alive.\n\nAlso Frank\u2019s claimed route still sounds stretched, and if he really looped through weapons/security, I\u2019d expect someone to have seen him, especially Diana moving around that side.\n\nI\u2019m voting Frank unless the last speaker has something huge."}}
{"timestamp": 1779351602.121949, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I don\u2019t have new sightings beyond what I already said: I went electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine. The only person I saw was Alice in upper engine around tick 6-7, coming from lower engine.\n\nFrom all the info, Frank is still the strongest suspect to me. Bob was confirmed alive in medbay at tick 11-12, Frank was seen entering medbay at tick 14, and then Bob is dead in electrical with Frank there when Diana reports. Diana could technically self-report, but Frank\u2019s route feels stretched and he was the one directly on the body.\n\nI\u2019m not 100% because I didn\u2019t see the body myself, but based on the timeline and everyone\u2019s confirmations, I\u2019m voting Frank."}}
